        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>SGR Sliding Glass Door First Impressions Door  Pull.</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis door pull is the perfect compliment to sliding glass doors, common in coastal areas.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWhy keep using those same old 1960's style factory handles? You don't have to anymore. Now you have a choice!\r\n</p>\r\n<P>\r\nOther designs also available: <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Sliding Glass Door Pull Handles\"><b>Sliding Glass Door Pulls</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n*This door pull is available in 2 different lengths.<br>\r\n*It has a 1-inch thickness. <br>\r\n*There are 2 choices on the center to center measurement: 6-5/8 or 9-5/8<br>\r\n*Door pull includes matching screw hardware.<br>\r\n*Door pulls are hand waxed with butchers wax to add longevity to the life of the finish.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\">\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSGR9 - Total Length 9\"<br>\r\nSGR12 - Total Length 12\"<br> \r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNow here's the really great part. These pulls are finished flat at each end, but like the picture at the right or larger view, we show you one with optional decorative finials at each end. The one illustrated uses the Urn ends (the finish is Antique Brass).\r\n</p>\r\nThe best thing of all is you can order your sliding glass door with the finial of your choice! To make them even more personal to your decor.\r\n</p>\r\n<b>We have five kinds of finials, from left to right:</b> Large Pineapple, Small Reeded Acorn,  Small Smooth Acorn, Urn, and Large Acorn. Note that the the finials are optional and priced as a PAIR (2). Enough to do one door pull.\r\n</p>\r\nThe finials will have the same finish as the door pull you choose.\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-Finish-6-2.jpg?v=1704354524\" width=\"438\" height=\"173\" border=\"0\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nDoor Pulls Sold individually. <b>*Finials are Optional</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sliding Glass Door Pull - Reeded Style FII-SGR",
                "description": "SGR Sliding Glass Door First Impressions Large Door  Pull.Make a bold statement !",
                "keywords": "first impressions, SGR, Sliding Glass,  door pulls, glass shower door, refrigerator, kitchen cabinets, entry door pulls, aluminum, rectangle, modern style, block, square, futuristic, reed style, english, rope,"
